{"version":1,"content":"<p>開源數據庫PostgreSQL 19.0現已正式發佈。開發團隊表示，此次版本在簡化工作負載管理、改進分佈式數據處理以及提升性能和開發者體驗方面帶來了多項更新。此前由於AI和大語言模型生成的大量缺陷報告以及安全問題，PostgreSQL 19的發佈進度曾推遲數周。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587136.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.170977+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:23:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:54.133747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:54.133747+00:00","content_hash":"b22003feba069d918d73049329784fe2bb2efc423abc9ca6bcc600b699f7ba18","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}